{"id":"vod_md_2182","vodId":"2182","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"大神与七位伙伴","name_cn":"大神与七位伙伴","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230809-1/48032bcae06a92008b5b02012d83ffdd.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在御伽学园里，大神凉子（伊藤静 配音）是一个身材娇小但个性十分凶悍的傲娇少女。在学园中，有一个名为御伽学园学生互助协会的神秘组织，而大神正是其中的一员。此外，还有患有视线恐惧症的跟踪狂森野亮士（入野自由 配音），外表可爱内心腹黑至极的赤井林檎（伊藤加奈惠 配音），异装癖患者桐木李斯特（野岛裕史 配音），成熟稳重的大姐姐桐木爱丽斯（堀江由衣 配音）等6人均是此神秘组织中的成员。扶助协会的任务是在紧要关头令需要帮助的人欠下人情，再在需要之时逼迫他们偿还债务，这看似无理的粗暴做法其实饱含了成员们的良苦用心。而为了让世界变得更好，大神和她的七个伙伴们每天都在不懈的努力着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-09 08:28:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/tvZsNoln/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/EDqsg5jJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/KqshhUkB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/DOI7UQkS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/J9dGtAJ6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/RHvesevA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/k8dFx5gn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/mjojprwf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/2geR1bfZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/sOHi7ckM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/mvtLraGu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/8RXFdT1s/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:31.731Z"}